  "codes": {
    "label": "Ticket (QR code and barcodes)",
    "options": {
      "width": "120mm",
      "height": "160mm"
    },
    "template": "<style>\n  body { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 18px; text-align: center; color: #111; }\n  .box { border: 2px solid #2563eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { margin: 6px 0; color: #2563eb; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"box\">\n  <img src=\"logo\" width=\"52\">\n  <h1>{{ event }}</h1>\n  <div>{{ name }} · seat {{ seat }}</div>\n  <p><barcode value=\"https://example.com/ticket/{{ code }}\" type=\"qr\" width=\"150\" /></p>\n  <p><barcode value=\"{{ code }}\" type=\"code128\" width=\"240\" height=\"50\" /></p>\n  <small>EAN-13: </small><barcode value=\"750103131130\" type=\"ean13\" width=\"150\" height=\"46\" />\n</div>\n<p style=\"color:#666;font-size:11px\">These are vector shapes: zoom in, they stay sharp, and they scan from the screen.</p>",
    "data": {
      "event": "Manila Tech Night",
      "name": "Maria Santos",
      "seat": "B-14",
      "code": "TKT20260042"
    }
  },
  "partials": {
    "label": "Partials and layouts",
    "options": {},
    "template": "{% extends \"layout\" %}\n{% block title %}Order confirmation{% endblock %}\n{% block body %}\n  <p>Hello {{ name }}, thank you for your order.</p>\n  <table>{% for item in items %}{% include \"row\" %}{% endfor %}</table>\n{% endblock %}",
    "data": {
      "name": "Ana",
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "Website hosting (12 months)",
          "qty": 1,
          "price": 1500
        },
        {
          "name": "Domain name",
          "qty": 1,
          "price": 450
        },
        {
          "name": "Design review",
          "qty": 3,
          "price": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    "partials": {
      "layout": "<style>\n  body { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 36px; color: #1f2937; }\n  header { border-bottom: 3px solid #2563eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  header h1 { margin: 0; color: #2563eb; }\n  footer { margin-top: 28px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 11px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-top: 6px; }\n  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; } td { padding: 7px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; } .r { text-align: right; }\n</style>\n<header><h1>{% block title %}{% endblock %}</h1></header>\n{% block body %}{% endblock %}\n<footer>Lands Horizon · generated in the browser with pdf-engine</footer>",
      "row": "<tr><td>{{ item.name }}</td><td class=\"r\">₱{{ item.qty * item.price }}</td></tr>"
    }
  },
  "languages": {
    "label": "Languages and the peso sign",
    "options": {},
    "template": "<style>\n  body { font-family: \"Noto Sans\", sans-serif; padding: 36px; line-height: 1.6; }\n  h1 { color: #2563eb; } .l { color: #6b7280; font-size: 11px; }\n</style>\n<h1>One font, several scripts</h1>\n<p><span class=\"l\">English</span><br>Price: ₱1,250.00</p>\n<p><span class=\"l\">Filipino</span><br>Magandang araw! Salamat po sa inyong pagbili.</p>\n<p><span class=\"l\">Cyrillic</span><br>Привет, мир! Это PDF, сделанный в браузере.</p>\n<p><span class=\"l\">Greek</span><br>Γειά σου κόσμε! Αυτό είναι ένα PDF από το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης.</p>\n<p><span class=\"l\">Vietnamese</span><br>Xin chào thế giới! Đây là tệp PDF tạo trong trình duyệt.</p>\n<p class=\"l\">Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Arabic, Thai and others work too: add a font that has them (see the docs).</p>",
    "data": {}
  },
  "images-base64": {
    "label": "Images: base64 (data: URI)",
    "options": {},
    "template": "<style>\n  body { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 36px; color: #1f2937; }\n  h1 { color: #2563eb; } .row { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; margin: 14px 0; }\n  code { background: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 5px; }\n</style>\n<h1>An image inside the template</h1>\n<p>The picture below is a PNG written as text in the data (a <code>data:</code> URI). It needs no network and no file, so it works everywhere.</p>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <img src=\"{{ logo }}\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n  <img src=\"{{ logo }}\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n  <img src=\"{{ logo }}\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n</div>\n<p>You can also write it straight into the HTML: <code>&lt;img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBOR...\"&gt;</code>.</p>\n<p>PNG, JPEG and GIF work. Tip: keep the picture small, because it travels inside the data.</p>",
    "data": {
      "logo": "data:image/png;base64,"
    }
  },
  "images-url": {
    "label": "Images: from a URL",
    "options": {},
    "template": "<style>\n  body { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 28px; color: #1f2937; }\n  h1 { color: #2563eb; } img.banner { width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; }\n  .note { background: #fef3c7; padding: 8px 12px; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 12px; }\n</style>\n<img class=\"banner\" src=\"{{ banner }}\">\n<h1>An image from a web address</h1>\n<p>The browser downloads it when the PDF is made, so the host must allow it (CORS). GitHub's raw file host does.</p>\n<p>The address is a value in the data, so you can change it in the Data tab.</p>\n<div class=\"note\">If the image is missing, the PDF is still made: a broken image is skipped, never an error.</div>",
    "data": {
      "banner": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lands-Horizon-Corp/pdf-engine/master/.public/demo/images/banner.png"
    }
  },
  "images-mapped": {
    "label": "Images: by name (your logo)",
    "options": {},
    "template": "<style>\n  body { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 36px; color: #1f2937; }\n  h1 { color: #2563eb; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n</style>\n<img src=\"logo\" width=\"90\">\n<h1>Your logo here</h1>\n<p>This page asked for <code>&lt;img src=\"logo\"&gt;</code>. The name <b>logo</b> is a file, Blob or bytes you pass in <code>images: { logo }</code>.\nUse the <b>Logo</b> button at the top to choose your own picture (PNG, JPEG or GIF) and watch it change.</p>\n<p>Passing images by name keeps big pictures out of the template and out of the data.</p>",
    "data": {}
  },
  "images-svg": {
    "label": "Images: inline SVG (vector)",
    "options": {},
    "template": "<style>\n  body { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 36px; color: #1f2937; }\n  h1 { color: #2563eb; }\n</style>\n<h1>Vector drawings</h1>\n<p>An <code>&lt;svg&gt;</code> element written in the template is drawn as shapes: sharp at any zoom, and the file stays small.</p>\n<svg width=\"260\" height=\"130\" viewBox=\"0 0 260 130\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"64\" r=\"58\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <path d=\"M20 96 L64 32 L108 96 Z\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n  <text x=\"150\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#111827\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">SVG</text>\n</svg>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b7280\">Note: an &lt;img&gt; that points at an .svg file is not drawn yet. Paste the &lt;svg&gt; into the template, or use PNG.</p>",
    "data": {}
  },
  "certificate": {
    "label": "Certificate (landscape)",
    "options": {
      "orientation": "landscape"
    },
    "template": "<style>\n  body { font-family: serif; text-align: center; color: #1f2937; margin: 0; }\n  .frame { margin: 28px; border: 6px double #2563eb; padding: 36px 40px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 40px; color: #2563eb; margin: 8px 0; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n  .name { font-size: 34px; border-bottom: 1px solid #9ca3af; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 40px; margin: 14px 0; }\n  .sig { display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 40px; font-size: 13px; }\n  .sig div { border-top: 1px solid #6b7280; padding-top: 4px; width: 200px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"frame\">\n  <img src=\"logo\" width=\"64\">\n  <h1>CERTIFICATE OF COMPLETION</h1>\n  <div>This certifies that</div>\n  <div class=\"name\">{{ name }}</div>\n  <div>has completed <b>{{ course }}</b> on {{ date }}.</div>\n  <div class=\"sig\"><div>{{ signer }}</div><div>Date</div></div>\n</div>",
    "data": {
      "name": "Maria Santos",
      "course": "Introduction to PDF Generation",
      "date": "October 26, 2026",
      "signer": "Lands Horizon Academy"
    }
  },
  "label": {
    "label": "Shipping label (4 x 6 in)",
    "options": {
      "width": "4in",
      "height": "6in"
    },
    "template": "<style>\n  body { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 14px; color: #000; }\n  .box { border: 3px solid #000; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .big { font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; }\n  .small { font-size: 11px; color: #444; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .c { text-align: center; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"box\"><div class=\"small\">Ship to</div><div class=\"big\">{{ to.name }}</div><div>{{ to.line1 }}</div><div>{{ to.city }}</div></div>\n<div class=\"box\"><div class=\"small\">From</div><div>{{ from }}</div></div>\n<div class=\"box c\"><barcode value=\"{{ tracking }}\" type=\"code128\" width=\"300\" height=\"70\" /><div style=\"font-family:monospace;margin-top:4px\">{{ tracking }}</div></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><barcode value=\"https://example.com/track/{{ tracking }}\" type=\"qr\" width=\"110\" /></div>",
    "data": {
      "to": {
        "name": "Ana Reyes",
        "line1": "45 Mabini St, Brgy. San Roque",
        "city": "Cebu City 6000"
      },
      "from": "Lands Horizon, 12 Rizal Ave, Manila",
      "tracking": "PH2026102600417"
    }
  }
